but also its dictionary files and generated word lists are covered by the AGPL.

Because this project is derived from Hspell's code and redistributes its
dictionary data (in a re-encoded UTF-8 form under data/hebrew.dict.gz, generated
from the original files kept under internal/gen/source/), hebmorph as a whole is
likewise licensed under the AGPL version 3. See the LICENSE file for the full
license text.

